        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova yavolera Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahaane amalago yaga ku vandu va Isiraeli lwa vaduuka mu kivala cha Yahova yalaga alavaha vamenye mu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa mulia ku viukulia vie kivala yiki, muvuguli kidieli kilala muhaane ku Yahova, keve kuli kihanwa kuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa mulomba migadi, mugadi gwu kutanga gwa mulomba kutura ku viukulia vienyu ivihia, muhaane ku Yahova gove kuli kihanwa kuye. Mulahaana kuli uvuswage vwa muhulaa koloze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku viukulia vienyu viosi viu kutanga, mulahaana kidieli kilala ku Yahova keve kuli kihanwa kuye. Mulakola ndio kali kuduuka ku visukululwi vienyu viosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa niiva mulala ku munyi alakola vwoni vugira kumanya, kandi avuli kolonda malago ga Yahova amali kuhaana ku Musa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi niiva vandu valavula kokora goosi ga Yahova amali kulaga kuvitira ku Musa madiku gaaza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi niiva yaga galakolwa vugira vandu kumanya, maku valahaana igiriki esoleri eve kuli kihanwa chu kusambwa, keveeye ni lifwunya liu mwayu mulahi guyaanzizaa Yahova. Mulahaana harara ni kihanwa chu vuswage kandi kihanwa chiwaini. Komeedaku, mulahaana kandi imburi ekole eve kuli kihanwa chu vwoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musaalisi alakola muluka gwu kukunika vwoni vwa vandu va Isiraeli. Valasamifwa, kigira gaali mahiolo ga vaakora vugira kumanya, kandi vamali koleta vihaanwa viavo viu vwoni, kandi vihaanwa viu kusambwa imbiri wa Yahova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu vosi va Isiraeli harara na vageni vamenyi hagati haavo, valasamifwa kigira vuli mundu yakola mahilo yaga vugira kumanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
